      "desc_en": "Multirole describes a use, not a separate aircraft class. Air weapons combined with bombs, rockets or torpedoes can support multiple missions. The first weapon slot determines the design role.\nBattlefield Support and Continuous Strike can improve CAS efficiency. The cited 145-150% is conditional, not universal. Higher efficiency does not directly multiply ground attack; check the selected mission."
