      "desc_en": "2 x [4x Machine Gun] means two modules and eight guns; the same rule applies to twin cannons. Enlargements preserve the actual weapon and special-module slots, including empty slots.\nCannon I is a 1939 technology; Anti-Tank Cannon II unlocks with 1940 anti-tank research. Jet engines, axial jets and advanced airframes need their own research or projects. Airframe year does not date every module."
