      "desc_en": "Extra fuel tanks and drop tanks extend range; armor plates and self-sealing tanks add air defense. Balance weight, thrust and cost for the operating area.\nCarrier designs serve fleet missions, while land-based use still needs adequate range. Check armor-piercing bombs, torpedoes and dive brakes under the relevant naval-strike mission, not only the default stats."
