      "desc_en": "Recon aircraft provide army intel. The cited 20% intel and roughly 6% ground-combat advantage depend on enemy reconnaissance, the intel gap and caps; they do not stack once per aircraft.\nA first-slot rocket rail gives a modern multirole design the CAS role for applicable production discounts. The cited 12.4% and 10% are country-specific examples. Check your actual production cost."
